## What we can help with

- Printability checks (wall thickness, overhangs, orientation)
- Minor edits (holes, tolerances, fit adjustments)
- Converting or recreating a model from measurements/photos (project dependent)

## If you don’t have a file

No problem — describe what you need, share any reference images and measurements, and we’ll advise the best way to proceed.

## Pricing

Design work is **quoted individually**. Simple adjustments may be included as part of the print job.

